<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Le=C2=A0lun. 21 sept. 2020 =C3=A0=C2=A012:35, Hannes=
 Tschofenig &lt;<a href=3D"mailto:Hannes.Tschofenig@arm.com" rel=3D"norefer=
rer noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Hannes.Tschofenig@arm.com</a>&gt; a =C3=
=A9crit=C2=A0:<u></u><u></u></p>
