<blockquote style=3D"border:none;border-left:solid #cccccc 1.0pt;padding:0i=
n 0in 0in 6.0pt;margin-left:4.8pt;margin-right:0in">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Hi Pascal,<br>
<br>
Thanks for the pointer to the draft.<br>
<br>
Since I am surveying implementations for the update of RFC 7925 (see <a hre=
f=3D"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-uta-tls13-iot-profile/" re=
l=3D"noreferrer noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-uta-tls13-iot-profile/</a>) I w=
as wondering whether there is an implementation of this approach.<br>
<br>
Ciao<br>
Hannes<br>
<br>
<br>
From: Pascal Urien &lt;<a href=3D"mailto:pascal.urien@gmail.com" rel=3D"nor=
eferrer noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">pascal.urien@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br>
Sent: Monday, September 21, 2020 11:44 AM<br>
To: Hannes Tschofenig &lt;<a href=3D"mailto:Hannes.Tschofenig@arm.com" rel=
=3D"noreferrer noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Hannes.Tschofenig@arm.com</a>&=
gt;<br>
Cc: Filippo Valsorda &lt;<a href=3D"mailto:filippo@ml.filippo.io" rel=3D"no=
referrer noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">filippo@ml.filippo.io</a>&gt;;
<a href=3D"mailto:tls@ietf.org" rel=3D"noreferrer noreferrer" target=3D"_bl=
ank">tls@ietf.org</a><br>
Subject: Re: [TLS] The future of external PSK in TLS 1.3<br>
<br>
Hi All<br>
<br>
Here is an example of PSK+ECDHE for IoT<br>
<br>
<a href=3D"https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-urien-tls-se-00" rel=3D"norefe=
rrer noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-urien-=
tls-se-00</a>=C2=A0 uses TLS1.3 server=C2=A0 PSK+ECDHE for secure elements<=
br>
<br>
The security level in these devices is as high as EAL5+<br>
<br>
The computing time is about 1.4s for a PSK+ECDHE session (AES-128-CCM, + se=
cp256r1)<br>
<br>
The real critical resource is the required RAM size, less than 1KB in our e=
xperiments<br>
<br>
The secure element=C2=A0 only needs a classical TCP/IP interface (i.e. sock=
ets like)<br>
<br>
Trusted PSK should avoid selfie attacks<br>
<br>
Pascal<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
Le lun. 21 sept. 2020 =C3=A0 11:29, Hannes Tschofenig &lt;mailto:<a href=3D=
